{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zone-0</strong> was created in just one week as a showcase of our free, publicly available Unreal Engine framework. This short horror experience was built to demonstrate how quickly and effectively developers can build immersive worlds with it \u2014 and we challenged ourselves to push its capabilities to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a quiet goodbye. You\u2019re just a low-clearance guard posted at the front gate of a sprawling facility no one talks about. For years, you watched people come and go\u2014never knowing what went on behind the reinforced walls. Now the project is being shut down. Decommissioned. Stripped for parts and packed away like it never existed. But on your final shift, something goes wrong. The ground shakes. Pipes burst. Sirens wail in. Whatever was buried in the dark isn\u2019t staying quiet. You were never meant to see what\u2019s inside. But now, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate flickering tunnels, broken labs, and looping corridors. The deeper you go the more you start to understand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Horror Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just immersive, sound-driven tension, environmental interaction, and storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Audio &amp; Design</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313600?t=1753955857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313600/eddd9c3024091b31ff2d2a2607b5dc939a809eff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753955857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313600/043441d2dd7d4cd493a814f752bf353382343165/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753955857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313600/043441d2dd7d4cd493a814f752bf353382343165/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753955857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zone-0</strong> was created in just one week as a showcase of our free, publicly available Unreal Engine framework. This short horror experience was built to demonstrate how quickly and effectively developers can build immersive worlds with it \u2014 and we challenged ourselves to push its capabilities to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a quiet goodbye. You\u2019re just a low-clearance guard posted at the front gate of a sprawling facility no one talks about. For years, you watched people come and go\u2014never knowing what went on behind the reinforced walls. Now the project is being shut down. Decommissioned. Stripped for parts and packed away like it never existed. But on your final shift, something goes wrong. The ground shakes. Pipes burst. Sirens wail in. Whatever was buried in the dark isn\u2019t staying quiet. You were never meant to see what\u2019s inside. But now, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate flickering tunnels, broken labs, and looping corridors. The deeper you go the more you start to understand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Horror Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just immersive, sound-driven tension, environmental interaction, and storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Audio &amp; Design</h2>","developers":["Breakbound Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313600/eb2602e86ef19299c07526f0ffc3e1f83b93c61c/header.jpg?t=1753955857","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3313600/1754138514/695197910ba136e96530bf3995fdc56efcae8591/1750978118/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749474227","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3313600/1754138514/695197910ba136e96530bf3995fdc56efcae8591/1750978118/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749474227","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3313600/1754138514/695197910ba136e96530bf3995fdc56efcae8591/1750978118/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749474227","id":257154173,"name":"Zone-0Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154173/aa8a68243bb8be3f1cefa24dd7e1c7dd5315c9e9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749474227"}],"name":"Zone-0","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Not yet determined<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Not yet determined<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Breakbound Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"com